<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Password Reset Request</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Arial', sans-serif;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            background-color: #f4f4f4;
        }
        .container {
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 20px;
            background-color: #fff;
            box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
        }
        header {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 10px 0;
        }
        header img {
            max-width: 100px;
            height: auto;
        }
        .reset-button {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 10px 20px;
            background-color: #3498db;
            color: #fff;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 5px;
            margin-top: 15px;
        }
        footer {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 20px 0;
            background-color: #333;
            color: #fff;
        }
        footer a{
            color: #fff;
        }
        .footer-links a, .footer-notice{
            font-size: small;
            color: #fff;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="container">
        <header>
            <img src="{{ logo }}" alt="{{ appname }} Logo">
        </header>

        <p>Hello {{ user }},</p>

        <p>We received a request to reset the password for your {{ appname }} account. If you initiated this request, please use the following reset code to complete the process:</p>

        <p><strong>Reset Code:</strong> {{ code }}</p>

        <p>Click on the following link to reset your password:</p>

        <p><a href="{{ link }}" class="reset-button">Reset Password</a></p>

        <p>If you didn't request a password reset, please ignore this message. Your account security is important to us.</p>

        <p>Thank you,<br>
            <strong>The {{ team }} Team</strong></p>

        <footer>
            <p class="footer-links">
                <a href="{{ sitelink }}" target="_blank">Visit Our Website</a>
                <span>|</span>
                <a href="{{ privacylink }}" target="_blank">Privacy Policy</a>
                <span>|</span>
                <a href="{{ contactslink }}" target="_blank">Contact Us</a>
            </p>
            <p  class="footer-notice">&copy; {{ appname }} {{ year }}. All rights reserved. Powered by {{ powered }}</p>
        </footer>
    </div>

</body>
</html>
